  "bodyHash": "c6c9e2de9af8ef64",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m5JXNZi.png?1\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>需要安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a> 模组方可使用！</strong></p>\n<p>此资源包使所有矿石（煤炭除外）带有清晰的轮廓光效，大幅降低挖矿时的寻找难度。该资源包专为搭配光影材质包设计，因为光影通常会使得洞穴更暗并降低矿石的可见度。本包通过提升对比度来解决这一问题，且不会破坏游戏的沉浸感。</p>\n<p>除了发光效果外，矿石还添加了清晰的连接边框，提升了视觉辨识度，帮助你更容易发现矿脉。当矿石部分被岩浆淹没、被方块遮挡或处于其他难以观察的位置时，也能更加醒目。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/10XlIcD.png\" width=\"458\" height=\"258\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BRivw2D.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"41\"></span></p>\n<p>💡自发光纹理</p>\n<p>🧩连接纹理</p>\n<p>包含以下特性的方块：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xM3aJYu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;钻石矿石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LFyKY9E.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;绿宝石矿石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kmuTe3Z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;铜矿石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CNtIu0l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;红石矿石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Knfi1gx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;青金石矿石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KABxb8o.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;金矿石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RvRYyBv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;铁矿石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cBxAhk6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;原矿块</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rdJq75Z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;下界矿石</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Y1yf1jb\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Y1yf1jb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"41\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/letN_Cn2UDw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>Bearded Goof YouTube 频道：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYshYfEfdDm-YTLP6QPLuXA\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYshYfEfdDm-YTLP6QPLuXA</a></p>",
